2600 SY=(SY+1)AND 3:GOSUB 2580
2610 M$="{wht}S{rvon}TYLE{rvof}: "+SN$(SY):GOSUB 2480:MT=TI+120:RETURN
2620 REM T: THE OTHER TUNE, NAMED ON THE STATUS LINE FOR 2 SECONDS
