2870 POKE 780,216:POKE 782,40:SYS 13312
2880 POKE 780,44:POKE 782,4:SYS 13312:POKE 780,48:POKE 782,216:SYS 13312
2890 POKE 198,0
2900 GET K$:IF K$="" THEN 2900
2910 POKE 780,36:POKE 782,4:SYS 13312:POKE 780,40:POKE 782,216:SYS 13312
2920 POKE 53269,1:K$="":RETURN
2930 REM START: TABLES, SETTINGS, SPRITES, MUSIC
2940 REM PROGRAM AT $4001, MEMORY TOP $9000 BELOW THE MUSIC (AS HEX64, C64DOKU)
2950 DV=PEEK(186):IF DV<8 THEN DV=8
2960 REM VL MINES AROUND A CELL (+16 = IT IS A MINE), SC 0 COVERED / 1 OPEN /
2970 REM 2 FLAG, AD SCREEN ADDRESS (BIG CELLS: AD = ROW, XX = COLUMN), SK FLOOD
2980 REM FILL STACK, ML WHERE THE MINES ARE.
